{"id":"cine","lemma":"cine","pos":"noun","rank":917,"glosses":["cinema, moviehouse","film (when specifying types of films)","cinema; A sophisticated or exemplary film, representative of the art of cinema."],"ipa":"/ˈθine/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"cines"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-cine.wav","examples":[{"text":"Estoy saliendo del cine.","en":"I'm leaving the theater.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/721732"},{"text":"Estaba en el cine.","en":"I was at a movie theater.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/43606"},{"text":"Estaba en un cine.","en":"I was at a movie theater.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/69368"},{"text":"¿Queréis ir al cine?","en":"Do you want to go to the movies?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/354627"},{"text":"Ayer fueron al cine.","en":"Yesterday, they went to the movies.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/524929"}]}